This is book and manga store implemented with using Angular. 
The project supports user authentication and profile editing, catalog browsing and filtering, cart management and order creation.


- Authentication
-- User registration and login with form (name, email, password, phone) validation
-- Current user stored using service/localStorage

- Product Catalog
-- Displays books and manga with image, price, rating, and reviews in card of product (actually idk what's wrong with loading image but it's not showing)

Supports filtering by:
- Title
- Author
- Language (multi-select)
- Category (multi-select)
- Rating (via star icons)

- Sorting: by price, rating, or name

And reset filters / apply user's preferred categories automatically

- Cart !(-- only after user is logged in)

-- Add product from catalog or from product detail page

-- Choose quantity before creating order

-- View subtotal, delivery cost (if under 50€), and total

-- Choose delivery or pick-up option

-- Choose payment method (required)


- Orders
View order history in tabs: Active, Completed, Canceled

-- Cancel active orders

-- View order details (products, date, total)

- Reviews !(only available for completed orders)
--  Submit one review per product (rating + comment)

-- Reviews include user name, rating, and date

- Profile
-- View and edit personal data: name, email, phone, address, preferred categories

-- Changes are validated and saved

